-- Nested restriction of actual module sheaves, independently audited.
-- The scalar comparison uses the identity sharp and restriction-of-scalars
-- definition; section carriers are the original module carriers. Naturality
-- uses named restriction-inc equations and original proof independence.
-- Lattice, slice, module-carrier and record projections are structural.
